n do for a person's activity and how that can impact their daily lives.","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":329,"renderedHeight":329,"naturalWidth":1080,"naturalHeight":1080,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"GOOD","altReason":"present, no red flags","bytes":452356},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/disability-inclusion/media/images/Alicia-Stevens.png","alt":"I want to be able to give everyone who comes into my future office the best quality of care that I can.","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":329,"renderedHeight":329,"naturalWidth":1080,"naturalHeight":1080,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"GOOD","altReason":"present, no red flags","bytes":735870},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/disability-inclusion/media/images/Angela-Breitmeyer.png","alt":"I champion inclusion for individuals with disabilities in my practice by respecting the humanity of everyone.","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":329,"renderedHeight":329,"naturalWidth":1080,"naturalHeight":1080,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"GOOD","altReason":"present, no red flags","bytes":642787},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/disability-inclusion/media/images/1.2-600px.png","alt":"A square graphic with photos of eight people of different races, ages, and sex. It’s captioned with 'Become a disability A.L.L.Y. A more inclusive practice improves the experience for all your patients.'","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":329,"renderedHeight":329,"naturalWidth":600,"naturalHeight":600,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"GOOD","altReason":"present, no red flags","bytes":407892},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/disability-inclusion/media/images/2.2-600px.png","alt":"A square graphic of